{"logId": "c9d1b76d-82c1-45c9-b3f2-6373b0bc2563", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——爱情", "block_bbox": [165, 140, 456, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [456.0, 140.0], [456.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "主题释义：", "block_bbox": [182, 215, 282, 241], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 215.0], [282.0, 215.0], [282.0, 241.0], [182.0, 241.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "爱情是人们生命中非常重要、美好的一部分，它是源于内心纯粹的爱，相互尊重、信任、关心，让对方因自己而感到甜蜜、浪漫、轻松、自由和幸福！在落后的观念中，爱情/婚姻的甜蜜和幸福通常只是一个阶段，很多人最终都化为了亲情，成为了一种责任、束缚、甚至痛苦或伤害的状态！在先进的文化理念中，爱情是尊重个体、崇尚自由、热烈奔放的，两个人各自拥有独立的人格和自由的权利，这种关系是平等的，像一个“人”字，相互给予和支撑，是彼此生命的伴侣！", "block_bbox": [180, 264, 1016, 484], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 264.0], [1016.0, 264.0], [1016.0, 484.0], [180.0, 484.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[24]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 612, 739], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [611.0, 716.0], [611.0, 738.0], [573.0, 738.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——爱情", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 492, 933], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [492.0, 900.0], [492.0, 933.0], [201.0, 933.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "标准等级：", "block_bbox": [217, 975, 319, 1002], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 975.0], [319.0, 975.0], [319.0, 1002.0], [217.0, 1002.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因感情/婚姻问题长期陷入痛苦、无奈、伤害的状态中。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [219, 1027, 917, 1053], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1027.0], [917.0, 1027.0], [917.0, 1053.0], [219.0, 1053.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：家人式相处的伴侣或夫妻关系，淡化或褪去了爱情的热烈和浪漫，更多转化成了习惯和亲情。（传统）", "block_bbox": [220, 1063, 1046, 1121], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1063.0], [1046.0, 1063.0], [1046.0, 1121.0], [220.0, 1121.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：自由的爱情状态，保持独立、平等和轻松，不彼此束缚。（自由）", "block_bbox": [220, 1133, 876, 1159], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1133.0], [876.0, 1133.0], [876.0, 1159.0], [220.0, 1159.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：始终享受爱情、浪漫甜蜜的状态。拥有真诚、信任、相互理解、相互关爱的习惯，因为喜欢而主动创造和享受两个人的生活时光。（甜蜜）", "block_bbox": [219, 1170, 1047, 1229], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1170.0], [1047.0, 1170.0], [1047.0, 1229.0], [219.0, 1229.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：灵魂伴侣式的爱情，既是生活上的伴侣，也是精神上的伴侣！非常美好而幸福的爱情状态！（深度契合）", "block_bbox": [219, 1239, 1048, 1298], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1239.0], [1048.0, 1239.0], [1048.0, 1298.0], [219.0, 1298.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[25]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 649, 1498], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.660077691078186, "coordinate": [165, 140, 456, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.